#: data/maps/FallarborTown_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:84
msgctxt "FallarborTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_LanetteGreeting"
msgid ""
"Oh, hello.\n"
"You are?\p"
"Okay, your name's {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"I can see that you're a TRAINER.\p"
"So that means you use the POKéMON\n"
"Storage System I developed.\p"
"How I arrived at that conclusion is\n"
"a simple deductive process.\p"
"You spoke to me because you wanted\n"
"to access something on this PC.\p"
"Oh, I'm sorry. I'm LANETTE.\p"
"Honestly, I'm glad to meet you--it's\n"
"great you're using the Storage System.\p"
"If you could, please visit me at home.\n"
"My house is on ROUTE 114.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，你好。你是？\p"
"好的，你叫{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"我看得出你是训练家。\p"
"这就说明你在使用我开发的\n"
"宝可梦寄放系统。\p"
"我是通过简单的推理得出这个结论的。\p"
"你跟我说话，是因为你想使用这台电脑。\p"
"哦，不好意思。我叫真由美。\p"
"说真的，很高兴认识你——你在\n"
"用我的寄放系统，真是太好了。\p"
"如果可以的话，请来我家玩吧。\n"
"我家在114号道路。$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:101
msgctxt "FallarborTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_FossilManiacEdgeOfTown"
msgid ""
"I wonder what POKéMON looked like\n"
"long, long ago?\p"
"Maybe the FOSSIL MANIAC at the edge\n"
"of town will know.$"
msgstr ""
"很久很久以前的宝可梦是什么样子的呢？\p"
"也许住在镇子边上的化石迷会知道。$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:107
msgctxt "FallarborTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_PlantHardyTrees"
msgid ""
"In the fields of FALLARBOR, we plant\n"
"seedlings of hardy trees that thrive\l"
"even in volcanic ash.$"
msgstr ""
"在秋叶镇的田地里，我们种下了即使在\n"
"火山灰中也能茁壮成长的树苗。$"
